### Create Group Savings
POST {{host}}/savings/group
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{customer_token}}

{
  "name": "Test2 group Savings",
  "description": "I am very sure that this works",
  "savingAmount": 200,
  "savingFrequency": "BI_WEEKLY",
  "meetingLocation": "Somewhere in the desert",
  "currency": "NGN"
}

### Get group saving by Id
GET{{host}}/savings/group/4e07052f-4bd0-4f2d-ac80-53d776c9e49b
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{customer_token}}

### Get user's group savings
GET{{host}}/savings/group?size=2&page=0
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{customer_token}}

### Create Group Savings Transaction
POST {{host}}/savings/group/record-transaction/4e07052f-4bd0-4f2d-ac80-53d776c9e49b
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{customer_token}}

{
  "amount": 500.35,
  "description": "Testing group transactions",
  "memberId": "054a080c-453e-44cc-8476-119e5f9765c6"
}